<title>FRANCE: Arthuis satisfied with dollar's rise.</title>
<headline>Arthuis satisfied with dollar's rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Wednesday that he was satisfied with the dollar's recent rise and he hoped current foreign exchange levels would be maintained.</p>
<p>&quot;I am satisfied...we must consolidate current foreign exchange parities,&quot; he told a news conference. &quot;Economic growth needs stable and equitable parities.&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;The inflationary impact of the dollar's rise will be peanuts,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
